A vast, dreamlike wheel floating in a twilight sky, painted in the swirling, luminous brushstrokes of Vincent van Gogh. The wheel contains countless interconnected scenes of human life—figures giving and receiving, rising and falling, all merging into one continuous flow of golden and deep blue energy. At the center, a single figure sits in peaceful meditation, neither grasping nor rejecting, while around them spiral luxurious objects (a sports car, jewels, mansions) transforming into wisps of starlight that dissolve into the cosmic background. The entire composition pulses with Van Gogh's signature turbulent energy, thick impasto strokes creating movement between scenes of material wealth and simple acts of kindness, all ultimately feeding back into the great celestial cycle. Cypress trees frame the bottom corners, reaching upward toward the spinning cosmic mandala above.
